            "heading": "Our Story",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At MY CRANBI, we believe that true beauty is nurtured through honesty, thoughtful innovation and the finest gifts of nature. Inspired by the richness of saffron and India's timeless botanical heritage, we create premium skincare and personal care products that blend nature with modern science to deliver care you can truly trust.</p>"
          }
        }
