          "type": "heading",
          "settings": { "heading": "Our Ingredients", "heading_size": "h1" }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every MY CRANBI formulation begins with nature's finest gifts — pure Kashmir saffron, cultivated and processed through our family's own MAA KESAR venture in Srinagar, alongside time-honoured Ayurvedic botanicals like amla, shikakai, and brahmi.</p>",
